<p>Thanks so much for your feedback. Some from this what I take is.</p>
<p>- The threat of the anomoly needs to be shown to actually add weight to it which gives the O5 meeting real purpose and urgency.<br />
- Back up this potential threat, with actual evidence of its power and danger.<br />
- Remove unnecessary redactions<br />
- Don't spoon feed the audience the information.<br />
- Expand on SCP-XXXX-1</p>
<p>Confirm or deny, but thank you so much, I would love it if you could read it again once I work on this feedback. Thx</p>

